From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Amaan Qureshi <git@amaanq.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 00:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] serial: 8250_mid: import the SERIAL_8250 namespace

8250_mid calls serial8250_wait_for_xmitr(), which 8250_port exports in
the SERIAL_8250 namespace, so modpost rejects the module.
---
diff --git a/drivers/tty/serial/8250/8250_mid.c b/drivers/tty/serial/8250/8250_mid.c
--- a/drivers/tty/serial/8250/8250_mid.c
+++ b/drivers/tty/serial/8250/8250_mid.c
@@ -415,3 +415,4 @@
 MODULE_AUTHOR("Intel Corporation");
 MODULE_LICENSE("GPL v2");
 MODULE_DESCRIPTION("Intel MID UART driver");
+MODULE_IMPORT_NS("SERIAL_8250");
